  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.1": "",
  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.2": "For an explanation of rendering _kathina_ as “robe-making ceremony”, see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.3": "",
  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.4": "For the first four of these five see [Bu Pc 46:5.6.1](pli-tv-bu-vb-pc46:5.6.1), [Bu Np 2:2.39.1](pli-tv-bu-vb-np2:2.39.1), [Bu Pc 32:8.15.1](pli-tv-bu-vb-pc32:8.15.1), and [Bu Np 1:2.17.1](pli-tv-bu-vb-np1:2.17.1) respectively. “Robe-cloth” renders _cīvara_, for which see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
